If we use the standard digit DP counting numbers in $[0, N]$, we include 0.
$S(0) = 0$.
If $min\_sum > 0$, then 0 is not counted.
If $min\_sum = 0$, 0 is counted.
The constraints say $1 \le min\_sum$. So 0 is never counted.
